  "historyNote": "#6349, eff 10-5-96; rpld by #7923, eff 7-24-03 New. #9306, eff 10-25-08; amd by #9993, eff 9-16-11; amd by #10506, eff 1-17-14; ss by #12142, eff 3-24-17; ss by #13102, eff 10-5-20 (formerly Ed 507.12) (see Revision Note at part heading for Ed 508); ss by #14368, eff 9-11-25, EXPIRES: 9-11-35",
